<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-008" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-shantao" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-shantao">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-shantao:nomination" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-shantao:nomination:m0000" ref="96a_987_925">山公</persName>舉<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-shantao:nomination:m0003" ref="ues_5wk_8tg">阮咸</persName>為吏部郎，目曰：「清真寡欲，萬物不能移也。」</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-shantao:qishi" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-shantao:qishi:m0000" ref="96a_987_925">濤</persName>薦<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-shantao:qishi:m0002" ref="ues_5wk_8tg">咸</persName>曰：『真素寡欲，深識清濁，萬物不能移也。若在官人之職，必妙絕於時。』詔用<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-008-jin043-shantao:qishi:m0039" ref="73j_8ub_z7e">陸亮</persName>。</p>
</text>
